{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0055","fact_refs":[2,5],"question":"On which two benchmark datasets does STransE outperform previous embedding models for link prediction?","answer":"STransE shows better link prediction performance than previous embedding models and other state-of-the-art methods on the WN18 and FB15k datasets."}
