{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0057","fact_refs":[4],"question":"How did wen2016multi improve the fine tuning method for spoken dialogue systems?","answer":"They improved the fine tuning method by pre-training with synthesized data, in a procedure for generating natural language across multiple dialogue system domains."}
